@startuml
title first_session — sequence
actor "first_timer" as U
participant "web_app" as S_0
participant "tool_workers" as S_1
participant "tang_nano" as S_2
== arrive (onboard) ==
U -> S_0 : support_check
note right of U : emotion 3/5 — pain: 対応ブラウザーかどうかがすぐにわからない
== choose_board (onboard) ==
U -> S_0 : board_select
note right of U : emotion 3/5 — pain: ボードの型番と名前の対応がわからない
== start_template (onboard) ==
U -> S_0 : template_open
note right of U : emotion 4/5
== first_build (use) ==
U -> S_0 : tool_download, build_progress
U -> S_1 : tool_download, build_progress
note right of U : emotion 2/5 — pain: 初回に約 79 MB を読み込む, どこまで進んだかわからない
== connect_board (use) ==
U -> S_0 : usb_permission
U -> S_2 : usb_permission
note right of U : emotion 2/5 — pain: WebUSB の許可ダイアログの意味がわからない, ドライバーの差し替えが要る OS がある
== first_write (use) ==
U -> S_0 : write_progress, write_result
U -> S_2 : write_progress, write_result
note right of U : emotion 5/5
@enduml
